    "shortDescription": "Aim the cat. Splat the furniture. Mind the aquarium.",
    "contentDescription": "If you have ever owned a cat, you already know they do not aim for the floor.\r\n\r\nPuking Cat is a funny cat game about a cute pet with terrible manners. Two taps turn a tidy room into a mess: lock the angle, lock the power, and let your naughty kitty do the rest. Mind the aquarium.\r\n\r\nTWO TAPS, ONE MESS\r\n- Aim your shot at furniture, hunt for bonus targets and avoid the things you should leave alone.\r\n- Watch slime pool on tables and drip onto objects below.\r\n- Beat the target score before you run out of shots to earn up to three stars.\r\n- Replay a room to find a better angle and improve your score.\r\n\r\nA CAT'S WORK IS NEVER DONE\r\n- Make mischief around the house and at the vet clinic.\r\n- Catch the patrolling robot vacuum for a bonus. Leave the toy car alone.\r\n- Dress your cat in costumes and choose a different slime colour in the shop.\r\n- Short rounds make this casual physics game easy to pick up for a little chaos.\r\n\r\nPLAY YOUR WAY\r\n- No account or sign-up. Your progress stays on your device.\r\n- Ads support the game, and the fail screen stays clear of full-screen ads.\r\n- Rewarded ads are optional.\r\n- Remove Ads is an optional subscription that clears the full-screen ads.\r\n\r\nThe room is not going to clean itself. It is about to get considerably worse.",
    "contentNewDescription": "A small fix for Galaxy.\n\n- Subscription cancellation now points to your Galaxy Store account, where your subscription actually lives\n\nSame cat. Slightly better directions.",
